<title>GERMANY: Three dead in German church bombing - police.</title>
<headline>Three dead in German church bombing - police.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three people were killed and about 10 seriously injured in a Christmas Eve bomb attack on a Frankfurt church, German police said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The attack occurred during a service at a Protestant church in the Frankfurt suburb of Sindlingen.</p>
</text>
